03:44:00.000 --> 03:44:03.120
Big story on action news tonight is the arraignment of an alleged kidnapper,

03:44:03.240 --> 03:44:08.280
a man who held an ex-girlfriend hostage through the long, hot afternoon in West Goshen, Chester County.

03:44:08.560 --> 03:44:12.040
Tonight, the suspect charged with kidnapping and other related charges.

03:44:12.180 --> 03:44:15.280
He's in jail under $100,000 bail.

03:44:17.530 --> 03:44:20.330
The incident began to unfold shortly after 1 o'clock.

03:44:20.490 --> 03:44:23.750
34-year-old Robert Riggs of Wagontown, Pennsylvania, near Coatesville,

03:44:23.830 --> 03:44:26.610
entered the liquor store, pulled out a .25-caliber revolver,

03:44:26.630 --> 03:44:29.370
and kept five employees at bay for more than five hours.

03:44:29.370 --> 03:44:29.810
Please.

03:44:30.000 --> 03:44:34.120
thought it was a robbery until they learned one of the hostages, 34-year-old Elizabeth Jackson,

03:44:34.420 --> 03:44:39.300
whose maiden name is Frederick, was an ex-girlfriend. It was a long waiting game until Riggs decided to

03:44:39.300 --> 03:44:43.660
release four of the hostages, but still police sharpshooters kept their sights trained on the

03:44:43.660 --> 03:44:48.680
door. At one point, Riggs came to the door to get some food left by police officers. Throughout the

03:44:48.680 --> 03:44:54.400
telephone negotiations, he demanded $50,000 in safe passage to Venezuela. Parents of both the gunman

03:44:54.400 --> 03:44:59.160
and hostage stood vigil and at times broke down from the emotional strain, but it wasn't until

03:44:59.160 --> 03:44:59.940
is passed to the Rep.

03:45:00.000 --> 03:45:03.920
Raymond Leslie of Parksburg talked to him that Riggs decided to release Miss

03:45:03.920 --> 03:45:08.080
Jackson and give himself up. Did you have any indication during the negotiations

03:45:08.080 --> 03:45:11.920
or during the standoff that you might lose this one or was everything running

03:45:11.920 --> 03:45:17.250
pretty smoothly? The negotiators felt that things were going pretty smoothly and

03:45:17.250 --> 03:45:21.430
we had it pretty well in hand. Riggs was taken to the West Goshen police station

03:45:21.430 --> 03:45:25.190
and later removed to an undisclosed location. His pastor would not talk to

03:45:25.190 --> 03:45:29.240
the media. He was quick to leave the police station. It was a tense standoff

03:45:29.240 --> 03:45:29.980
between places

03:45:30.000 --> 03:45:35.260
and Riggs, but in the end, the hostages are okay, and Riggs is in custody. Now police must sort out

03:45:35.260 --> 03:45:40.720
the facts of this case and find out what prompted Riggs to enter that liquor store. I'm Gary Majors,

