03:46:48.440 --> 03:46:51.260
Bad economic news tonight for the depressed city of Chester.

03:46:51.640 --> 03:46:55.420
The Pennsylvania Shipbuilding Company lost the bid to refit the battleship Iowa.

03:46:55.890 --> 03:46:59.610
The contract will go to a Mississippi firm. Navy officials announced the decision today.

03:47:00.120 --> 03:47:04.420
And the commander of the Philadelphia Navy Yard told reporters how the decision was reached.

03:47:04.980 --> 03:47:09.640
They looked at the yard's management, its ability to plan the work.

03:47:09.820 --> 03:47:15.220
They looked at the yard's resources, and they also looked at the yard's capabilities.

03:47:16.100 --> 03:47:18.460
Commander Hansen didn't comment on the Penn Ship incident,

03:47:19.120 --> 03:47:23.340
but sources indicate the local yard's never done any major overhauls for the Navy.

03:47:23.480 --> 03:47:25.120
The Mississippi Company has.

03:47:25.360 --> 03:47:27.360
It had to be a blow to the shipyard.

03:47:27.520 --> 03:47:29.960
After all, in the past 18 months, the workforce...

03:47:30.000 --> 03:47:33.360
had already dwindled from 4,200 to 1,000.

03:47:33.540 --> 03:47:35.760
And while Pennsylvania Shipbuilding President C.N.

03:47:35.840 --> 03:47:38.500
Payne confirmed by phone that the yard would continue

03:47:38.500 --> 03:47:41.680
to seek all commercial opportunities and repair work,

03:47:41.860 --> 03:47:44.800
the loss of the Iowa contract came as a shock

03:47:44.800 --> 03:47:48.220
to workers like Thomas Jennings, a 22-year veteran

03:47:48.220 --> 03:47:49.120
electric welder.

03:47:49.440 --> 03:47:51.760
I think it was really a disgrace, a shame.

03:47:52.140 --> 03:47:55.540
It knocked all the hopes down for the men.

03:47:55.760 --> 03:47:57.780
I've been here since I was 13 years old,

03:47:57.780 --> 03:47:59.960
And I kept hearing Chester going down.

03:48:00.000 --> 03:48:08.270
going down. Now, I can see it. And if we don't get something in here big, in fact, a lot of

03:48:08.270 --> 03:48:12.960
folks are going to lose their homes. Chester Mayor Joseph Battle told me he felt the Navy's

03:48:12.960 --> 03:48:18.400
decision to award the Iowa Project to Mississippi smacked of regional discrimination and a lack of

03:48:18.400 --> 03:48:23.280
Reagan administration sensitivity to Chester's unemployment problem. Pennsylvania shipbuilding

03:48:23.280 --> 03:48:29.500
is in the running for a $270 million ship reconditioning contract, and Mayor Battle wants it badly.

03:48:30.000 --> 03:48:34.340
I know I'm going to get on the back of our congressional senatorial delegation,

